    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>This man is a threat to the entirety of Core City. He was involved in numerous power outage sabotages as well as countless spying activities. On top of that, we have reasons to believe that he's the forger we've been looking for responsible for creation of copious amounts of counterfeit metro tickets.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
